      "message": "B687-B692 audit three authentic rank103 pairs and continue priority native flops\n\nPrepare independent publication of B684's three genuine rank103 GTO/NL2 paired flops and B686's one rank121 partial. Require complete original job, strict two-seat, rendered-policy, pool-lock, medium, viewer and navigation audits before candidate creation. Registry remains 147 CERT / 245 APPROX until verified candidates are published.\n\nResume the already fully audited B685 artifact after the legacy queue-only bot commit changed the PR head. Keep the original head-lease guard and authenticate all successful audit steps; do not rerun original solves or completed full suites.\n\nLaunch nine new distinct flops across high-priority ranks75,84,121, using actual displayed routes and strict original-root gates before downstream solving. Rank75 excludes mid-high textures absent from its UI. Preserve existing certificates, keep PR #2 draft, and never merge.",
